  "description": "<img width=\"30%\" src=\"https://gtif-ukif.github.io/gtif-ukif-client/assets/EDA-logo.png\">\n\nTime series of the column of excess methane from waste in Spain. We see a somewhat consistent excess of methane from about June 2025 to October 2025, along with a coincident Tanager and Sentinel-2 data on July 19th, 2025, and EMIT and Sentinel-2 on June 23, 2025 showing excess methane emissions. The vertical dot-dashed lines correspond to detected methane plumes from the EMIT and Tanager satellites.",
